Version 0.51.4 uses the Elixir implementation under `elixir/`. One application
supports Bluesky and Mastodon through separate modes and configuration
directories. Dependency attribution and corresponding source are documented in
`elixir/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` and included with release packages.

Safeguards are part of the program behavior. Review is the default; explicit
automatic mode is limited to newly generated originals and eligible public
mention replies, with stricter screening, source revalidation, a persistent
attempt budget, and unresolved-publication lockout. Privacy exclusions,
opt-outs, do-not-contact enforcement, ownership validation, and uncertain
publication handling apply before publication. Automatic likes, favourites,
boosts, and reposts are disabled.

